  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Client Modules**\n\nOkay, I\'m now structuring the client application modules with a focus on clean design. I\'m starting by architecting `src/firebase.ts`. This module will initialize Firebase using a configuration file, `/firebase-applet-config.json`. Furthermore, I intend to export `auth`, `db`, and `storage` components, alongside an error handler for Firestore.\n\n\n**Refining Type Definitions**\n\nI\'ve been working on refining the type definitions in `src/types/index.ts`, focusing on the report types, user profiles, and other key data structures, ensuring they accurately represent the data we\'ll be handling. I\'ve also incorporated the connection test with `getDocFromServer` as required, and implemented `AuthContext.tsx`. This module handles Firebase authentication, including Google Sign-In, email/password registration, login, and logout, and admin role checks. It also exposes several crucial states and methods, such as `isAdmin`, `userProfile`, `signInWithGoogle`, and more.\n\n\n**Defining Data Abstractions**\n\nI am now focusing on defining data abstractions within the application. I am outlining the client-side API, with functions like `subscribeToReports`, `getReportById`, and `createReport`. I\'m also including methods for report status updates and deletions, as well as functions for user notifications, feedback management, and initial data seeding for a richer user experience. Specifically, I\'m fleshing out methods to handle AI interactions.\n\n\n**Designing UI Components**\n\nI\'m currently designing the application\'s UI components. I\'m starting with `Navbar.tsx`, which will feature the \"FixMyRAK\" brand logo and a UAE civic emblem, a responsive mobile menu, and user authentication components. Then, I\'ll be moving on to the `Footer.tsx`, which will include the brand tagline and disclaimer information. The `MapComponent.tsx` will be rendered dynamically with Leaflet, centered on Ras Al Khaimah.\n\n\n**Developing UI Features**\n\nI\'m now implementing location picker mode, allowing users to drop pins on the map in the submission form for precise latitude/longitude selection, with address lookup and presets for key RAK areas. I\'m also working on `AuthModal.tsx`, with clean tabs, Google sign-in, and form validation. Furthermore, I\'ve started on `NotificationDrawer.tsx`, with real-time sync, and finally on `HomePage.tsx` with a hero section, stats, and a breakdown of categories.\n\n\n**Constructing Report Pages**\n\nI\'m now focusing on creating the report exploration and submission pages. For the exploration page (`src/pages/ExploreReportsPage.tsx`), I\'m building out a comprehensive search and filter engine with keyword search, category pills, status dropdown, and date sorting, as well as grid and list views. Report cards will showcase photos, status badges, and more, and a detail modal will provide a status history timeline and admin actions. The submission page (`src/pages/ReportSubmissionPage.tsx`) will feature a form with Gemini AI assistance for problem description, including categorization, title suggestions, description enhancement, and duplicate detection. Location selection will include map pins, GPS, landmarks, and text input. Photo upload will be drag and drop.\n\n\n**Implementing Report Pages**\n\nI\'m now implementing the components for the submission page, including photo previews with file size limits, form validation, and direct Cloud Firestore submissions. I\'m also working on the map page, a full-screen interactive explorer with filters and side-sheet details. The user dashboard is in progress, with stats, tabbed views for reports, notifications, and profile details, along with report actions. I am also working on an admin dashboard with metrics, charts, and a full report triage table with search, filters, and status changes.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_31558"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type ReportCategory =\\n  | \'Roads and Potholes\'\\n  | \'Streetlights\'\\n  | \'Waste Management\'\\n  | \'Pavements\'\\n  | \'Public Facilities\'\\n  | \'Other Infrastructure\';\\n\\nexport type ReportStatus = \'Submitted\' | \'Under Review\' | \'In Progress\' | \'Resolved\';\\n\\nexport interface Report {\\n  id: string;\\n  userId: string;\\n  authorName?: string;\\n  authorEmail?: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  category: ReportCategory;\\n  location: string;\\n  latitude: number;\\n  longitude: number;\\n  imageURL?: string;\\n  status: ReportStatus;\\n  isVerified?: boolean;\\n  flagged?: boolean;\\n  aiSummary?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  updatedAt?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ReportUpdate {\\n  id: string;\\n  reportId: string;\\n  previousStatus: ReportStatus;\\n  newStatus: ReportStatus;\\n  message?: string;\\n  adminId: string;\\n  adminName?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface UserNotification {\\n  id: string;\\n  userId: string;\\n  reportId?: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  message: string;\\n  read: boolean;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface UserFeedback {\\n  id: string;\\n  userId?: string;\\n  userName?: string;\\n  rating: number;\\n  category?: string;\\n  message: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface UserProfile {\\n  uid: string;\\n  displayName?: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  photoURL?: string;\\n  role: \'user\' | \'admin\';\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AICategorizeResult {\\n  category: ReportCategory;\\n  suggestedTitle: string;\\n  shortSummary: string;\\n  urgency: \'low\' | \'medium\' | \'high\' | \'critical\';\\n  reasoning: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AIEnhanceResult {\\n  enhancedDescription: string;\\n  keyPoints: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AIDuplicateCandidate {\\n  reportId: string;\\n  similarityScore: number;\\n  matchReason: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport