              text: "                  <strong>Report Submission:</strong> Citizen submits a photo, detailed description, and map coordinates. Report receives status <span className=\"font-bold text-amber-700\">Submitted</span>."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
