  planner_response {
    response: "### FixMyRAK \342\200\224 AI-Powered Community Infrastructure Reporting Platform\n\n**FixMyRAK** is now live and fully operational for the Emirate of Ras Al Khaimah, UAE.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built\n\n1. **Brand & Visual Identity**\n   - **Civic Tech Design**: Designed for Ras Al Khaimah with high-contrast emerald, teal, and slate styling, custom iconography, responsive layouts, and typography.\n   - **Transparent Civic Notice**: Clear disclosure that reports foster public awareness and municipal resolution tracking without falsely claiming government endorsement.\n\n2. **Full-Stack Architecture & Google Gemini AI Integration**\n   - **Server-Side AI Runtime (`server.ts`)**: Built with `@google/genai` and `gemini-3.8-flash` on an Express backend mounted with Vite middlewares.\n   - **Intelligent Categorization & Title Suggestion**: Analyzes citizen descriptions to automatically classify into civic categories (*Roads & Potholes*, *Streetlights*, *Waste Management*, *Pavements*, *Public Facilities*, *Other Infrastructure*) and suggest professional titles.\n   - **AI Description Enhancement**: Polishes readability and clarity while preserving all original factual details without hallucinating.\n   - **Duplicate Detection Assistance**: Compares incoming reports against active neighborhood submissions to flag possible duplicates.\n   - **Admin AI Executive Triage**: Generates one-click incident briefings, urgency assessments, and recommended routing for coordinators.\n\n3. **Cloud Firestore & Firebase Integration**\n   - **Database Blueprint & Hardened Security Rules (`firestore.rules`)**: Deployed ABAC rules covering `users`, `admins`, `reports`, `updates`, `notifications`, and `feedback`.\n   - **Real-Time Data Sync**: Firestore `onSnapshot` listeners power the community metrics, explorer feeds, and live notifications.\n   - **Authentication System**: Google Sign-In via popup, Email/Password registration and login, password reset, and user profile sync.\n   - **Bootstrapped Admin Access**: Bootstrapped for `kevinantonakhil@gmail.com` with administrative controls.\n\n4. **Interactive Ras Al Khaimah Map & Coordinate Picker**\n   - **Interactive Leaflet Engine**: Centered on Ras Al Khaimah with quick district shortcuts (Al Nakheel, Corniche Al Qawasim, Al Hamra Village, Mina Al Arab, Khuzam, Al Dhait, Jebel Jais).\n   - **Color-Coded Status Pins**: Visual distinction for *Submitted* (amber), *Under Review* (sky), *In Progress* (violet), and *Resolved* (emerald).\n   - **Submission Map Picker**: Drag-and-drop pin selector and GPS geolocation with preset landmarks.\n\n5. **Complete Page Suite**\n   - **Homepage**: Hero, real-time Firestore statistics, 4-step process guide, category filters, interactive map preview, recent reports feed, and call to action.\n   - **Explore Reports**: Full-text search, category pills, status toggles, sort options, and Grid/List view switcher.\n   - **Report Submission**: Form validation, photo upload preview, AI assistance toolbar, interactive location picker, and instant database submission.\n   - **Report Detail Modal**: Photographic viewer, GPS coordinates, status history timeline, Google Maps link, and author deletion rights.\n   - **Citizen Dashboard**: Personal report metrics, status timeline, deletion confirmation for submitted reports, and profile details.\n   - **Admin Coordination Center**: Report management table, status progression updater, administrative update notes, verified/flagged toggles, AI summaries, analytics, and citizen feedback viewer.\n   - **Citizen Feedback & Transparency**: 5-star rating system, About page, FAQ, emergency disclaimer (999 for emergencies), Privacy Policy, and Terms of Use."
    thinking: "**Verifying Project Goals**\n\nI\'ve successfully completed the `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` tasks, both error-free! Now, I\'m meticulously checking the user\'s requirements to ensure alignment. This includes the branding identity of FixMyRAK, its Ras Al Khaimah UAE civic focus, and the tagline \"Your Community. Your Voice. A Better RAK.\" I am focusing now on Frontend pages.\n\n\n**Defining Frontend Architecture**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the frontend pages: Homepage, Explore Reports, Interactive Map, Report Submission, User Dashboard, and Admin Dashboard. Each will have specific components. I\'m focusing on the user interface and functionality. The Report Submission page incorporates key features like an interactive map and **Gemini 3.8 Flash AI Assistant**. The interactive map will be focused on RAK, including specific areas.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "### FixMyRAK \342\200\224 AI-Powered Community Infrastructure Reporting Platform\n\n**FixMyRAK** is now live and fully operational for the Emirate of Ras Al Khaimah, UAE.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built\n\n1. **Brand & Visual Identity**\n   - **Civic Tech Design**: Designed for Ras Al Khaimah with high-contrast emerald, teal, and slate styling, custom iconography, responsive layouts, and typography.\n   - **Transparent Civic Notice**: Clear disclosure that reports foster public awareness and municipal resolution tracking without falsely claiming government endorsement.\n\n2. **Full-Stack Architecture & Google Gemini AI Integration**\n   - **Server-Side AI Runtime (`server.ts`)**: Built with `@google/genai` and `gemini-3.8-flash` on an Express backend mounted with Vite middlewares.\n   - **Intelligent Categorization & Title Suggestion**: Analyzes citizen descriptions to automatically classify into civic categories (*Roads & Potholes*, *Streetlights*, *Waste Management*, *Pavements*, *Public Facilities*, *Other Infrastructure*) and suggest professional titles.\n   - **AI Description Enhancement**: Polishes readability and clarity while preserving all original factual details without hallucinating.\n   - **Duplicate Detection Assistance**: Compares incoming reports against active neighborhood submissions to flag possible duplicates.\n   - **Admin AI Executive Triage**: Generates one-click incident briefings, urgency assessments, and recommended routing for coordinators.\n\n3. **Cloud Firestore & Firebase Integration**\n   - **Database Blueprint & Hardened Security Rules (`firestore.rules`)**: Deployed ABAC rules covering `users`, `admins`, `reports`, `updates`, `notifications`, and `feedback`.\n   - **Real-Time Data Sync**: Firestore `onSnapshot` listeners power the community metrics, explorer feeds, and live notifications.\n   - **Authentication System**: Google Sign-In via popup, Email/Password registration and login, password reset, and user profile sync.\n   - **Bootstrapped Admin Access**: Bootstrapped for `kevinantonakhil@gmail.com` with administrative controls.\n\n4. **Interactive Ras Al Khaimah Map & Coordinate Picker**\n   - **Interactive Leaflet Engine**: Centered on Ras Al Khaimah with quick district shortcuts (Al Nakheel, Corniche Al Qawasim, Al Hamra Village, Mina Al Arab, Khuzam, Al Dhait, Jebel Jais).\n   - **Color-Coded Status Pins**: Visual distinction for *Submitted* (amber), *Under Review* (sky), *In Progress* (violet), and *Resolved* (emerald).\n   - **Submission Map Picker**: Drag-and-drop pin selector and GPS geolocation with preset landmarks.\n\n5. **Complete Page Suite**\n   - **Homepage**: Hero, real-time Firestore statistics, 4-step process guide, category filters, interactive map preview, recent reports feed, and call to action.\n   - **Explore Reports**: Full-text search, category pills, status toggles, sort options, and Grid/List view switcher.\n   - **Report Submission**: Form validation, photo upload preview, AI assistance toolbar, interactive location picker, and instant database submission.\n   - **Report Detail Modal**: Photographic viewer, GPS coordinates, status history timeline, Google Maps link, and author deletion rights.\n   - **Citizen Dashboard**: Personal report metrics, status timeline, deletion confirmation for submitted reports, and profile details.\n   - **Admin Coordination Center**: Report management table, status progression updater, administrative update notes, verified/flagged toggles, AI summaries, analytics, and citizen feedback viewer.\n   - **Citizen Feedback & Transparency**: 5-star rating system, About page, FAQ, emergency disclaimer (999 for emergencies), Privacy Policy, and Terms of Use."
