  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Website\'s Styles**\n\nI\'ve just added the base styles to `src/index.css`.  I\'ve integrated TailwindCSS and set up root variables for color-scheme and key color definitions like page, surface, and ink. These initial values aim for a light mode aesthetic and will be the foundation for the application\'s visual identity. I\'m starting here to define the basic look of the site.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_65972"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n:root {\\n  color-scheme: light;\\n  --page: #f6f7f3;\\n  --surface: #ffffff;\\n  --ink: #1c302c;\\n  --muted: #74817b;\\n  --line: #e4e9e1;\\n  --green: #143d35;\\n  --green-hover: #205347;\\n  --green-soft: #e8f1e9;\\n  --lime: #d7edbd;\\n  --orange: #e97950;\\n  --shadow: 0 16px 46px rgba(32, 54, 43, 0.08);\\n  --radius: 22px;\\n}\\n\\n@layer base {\\n  body {\\n    font-family: \'DM Sans\', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\\n    color: var(--ink);\\n    background-color: var(--page);\\n    line-height: 1.55;\\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\\n  }\\n\\n  h1, h2, h3, h4 {\\n    font-family: \'Manrope\', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom leaflet marker styling matching FixMyRAK palette */\\n.custom-pin {\\n  display: flex;\\n  align-items: center;\\n  justify-content: center;\\n  border-radius: 9999px;\\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(20, 61, 53, 0.25);\\n  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\\n  cursor: pointer;\\n}\\n\\n.custom-pin:hover {\\n  transform: scale(1.15);\\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(20, 61, 53, 0.35);\\n}\\n\\n.custom-pin-pulse {\\n  animation: pulse-ring 2s cubic-bezier(0.215, 0.61, 0.355, 1) infinite;\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes pulse-ring {\\n  0% {\\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(20, 61, 53, 0.5);\\n  }\\n  70% {\\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 14px rgba(20, 61, 53, 0);\\n  }\\n  100% {\\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(20, 61, 53, 0);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n.font-manrope {\\n  font-family: \'Manrope\', sans-serif;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update CSS variables and base typography to match the exact #f6f7f3 natural background, Manrope headings, and palette of the reference website\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating index.css\", \"toolSummary\":\"Match reference site background and typography\"}"
