  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining UI Elements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the UI elements within `ReportSubmissionPage.tsx`. Specifically, I\'m working to refine the aesthetic of the AI buttons and the submit button. I\'m aligning them precisely with the desired form card style, ensuring the borders, colors, and rounding are consistent and the text is as it should be. The AI buttons\' specific colors are in my mind too.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_52521"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Update form styling, AI buttons, and submit CTA in ReportSubmissionPage\", \"EndLine\":480, \"Instruction\":\"Apply palette to form container and buttons in ReportSubmissionPage\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"      {/* Main Form */}\\n      <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className=\\\"space-y-8 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[#e4e9e1] shadow-xs\\\">\\n        {/* Section 1: Problem Description & Gemini AI Assistant */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-sm font-bold text-[#143d35] font-manrope\\\">\\n              1. What is the issue? <span className=\\\"text-[#e97950]\\\">*</span>\\n            </label>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#74817b]\\\">\\n              {description.length} characters\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <textarea\\n            required\\n            rows={4}\\n            value={description}\\n            onChange={(e) => setDescription(e.target.value)}\\n            placeholder=\\\"e.g. There is a deep pothole on the right lane near the roundabout leading towards Corniche Al Qawasim. Vehicles are swerving to avoid tire damage...\\\"\\n            className=\\\"w-full p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm border border-[#e4e9e1] rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#143d35] focus:outline-hidden bg-[#f6f7f3]/50 leading-relaxed text-[#1c302c]\\\"\\n          />\\n\\n          {/* AI Action Buttons Toolbar */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-1\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={handleAiCategorize}\\n              disabled={isCategorizing}\\n              className=\\\"px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#e8f1e9] hover:bg-[#dcebd4] text-[#143d35] text-xs font-bold border border-[#143d35]/20 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n            >\\n              {isCategorizing ? (\\n                <RefreshCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-spin\\\" />\\n              ) : (\\n                <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#143d35]\\\" />\\n              )}\\n              <span>AI Categorize & Suggest Title</span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={handleAiEnhance}\\n              disabled={isEnhancing}\\n              className=\\\"px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#fff0e8] hover:bg-[#ffe2d3] text-[#e97950] text-xs font-bold border border-[#e97950]/25 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n            >\\n              {isEnhancing ? (\\n                <RefreshCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-spin\\\" />\\n              ) : (\\n                <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#e97950]\\\" />\\n              )}\\n              <span>AI Polish Clarity</span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={handleCheckDuplicates}\\n              disabled={isCheckingDuplicates}\\n              className=\\\"px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#efebf8] hover:bg-[#e4def0] text-[#6b21a8] text-xs font-bold border border-[#6b21a8]/25 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n            >\\n              {isCheckingDuplicates ? (\\n                <RefreshCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-spin\\\" />\\n              ) : (\\n                <Search className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#6b21a8]\\\" />\\n              )}\\n              <span>Check for Duplicates</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* AI Feedback Notices */}\\n          {aiCategorizeNotice && (\\n            <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-[#e8f1e9] border border-[#143d35]/20 rounded-xl text-xs text-[#143d35] animate-in fade-in\\\">\\n              {aiCategorizeNotice}\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {aiEnhanceKeyPoints.length > 0 && (\\n            <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-[#fff0e8] border border-[#e97950]/20 rounded-xl text-xs text-[#c2410c] animate-in fade-in\\\">\\n              <p className=\\\"font-bold mb-1\\\">Key Extracted Points:</p>\\n              <ul className=\\\"list-disc list-inside space-y-0.5 text-[#9a3412]\\\">\\n                {aiEnhanceKeyPoints.map((pt, idx) => (\\n                  <li key={idx}>{pt}</li>\\n                ))}\\n              </ul>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Duplicate check results card */}\\n          {duplicateCheckDone && (\\n            <div className=\\\"p-4 bg-[#efebf8]/80 border border-[#6b21a8]/20 rounded-2xl text-xs space-y-2 animate-in fade-in\\\">\\n              <p className=\\\"font-bold text-[#581c87] flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                <Search className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#6b21a8]\\\" />\\n                Duplicate Detection Analysis:\\n              </p>\\n              {duplicateCandidates.length === 0 ? (\\n                <p className=\\\"text-[#6b21a8]\\\">\\n                  No matching reports found nearby. Your issue appears to be unique!\\n                </p>\\n              ) : (\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-2 pt-1\\\">\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-[#6b21a8]\\\">\\n                    We found {duplicateCandidates.length} potential existing report(s) describing similar concerns. Please verify if one of these matches your problem:\\n                  </p>\\n                  <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-[#6b21a8]/20 bg-white/90 rounded-xl border border-[#6b21a8]/20 p-2\\\">\\n                    {duplicateCandidates.map((dup) => {\\n                      const matchingReport = existingReports.find((r) => r.id === dup.reportId);\\n                      return (\\n                        <div key={dup.reportId} className=\\\"py-2 px-1\\\">\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-[#581c87]\\\">\\n                            <span>{matchingReport?.title || \'Report #\' + dup.reportId}</span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] bg-[#efebf8] text-[#6b21a8] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\\\">\\n                              Match: {Math.round(dup.similarityScore * 100)}%\\n                            </span>\\n                          </div>\\n                          <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#7e22ce] mt-0.5\\\">{dup.matchReason}</p>\\n                        </div>\\n                      );\\n                    })}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Section 2: Title and Category */}\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 pt-4 border-t border-[#e4e9e1]\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-sm font-bold text-[#143d35] font-manrope mb-1.5\\\">\\n              2. Report Title <span className=\\\"text-[#e97950]\\\">*</span>\\n            </label>\\n            <input\\n              type=\\\"text\\\"\\n              required\\n              minLength={3}\\n              maxLength={150}\\n              value={title}\\n              onChange={(e) => setTitle(e.target.value)}\\n              placeholder=\\\"e.g. Hazardous Pothole on Corniche Road\\\"\\n              className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm border border-[#e4e9e1] rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#143d35] focus:outline-hidden bg-[#f6f7f3]/50\\\"\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-sm font-bold text-[#143d35] font-manrope mb-1.5\\\">\\n              3. Category <span className=\\\"text-[#e97950]\\\">*</span>\\n            </label>\\n            <select\\n              value={category}\\n              onChange={(e) => setCategory(e.target.value as ReportCategory)}\\n              className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm border border-[#e4e9e1] rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#143d35] focus:outline-hidden bg-[#f6f7f3]/50 font-medium text-[#1c302c]\\\"\\n            >\\n              {categories.map((cat) => (\\n                <option key={cat} value={cat}>\\n                  {cat}\\n                </option>\\n              ))}\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Section 3: Location Details & Interactive Map Picker */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-[#e4e9e1]\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-sm font-bold text-[#143d35] font-manrope mb-1\\\">\\n              4. Location in Ras Al Khaimah <span className=\\\"text-[#e97950]\\\">*</span>\\n            </label>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-[#74817b] mb-2\\\">\\n              Enter the street/neighborhood name and drop the pin precisely on the map below.\\n            </p>\\n            <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n              <MapPin className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#143d35] absolute left-3 top-3\\\" />\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                required\\n                value={locationLabel}\\n                onChange={(e) => setLocationLabel(e.target.value)}\\n                placeholder=\\\"e.g. Corniche Al Qawasim, near Al Fanar Restaurant\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm border border-[#e4e9e1] rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#143d35] focus:outline-hidden bg-[#f6f7f3]/50\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Interactive Location Picker Map */}\\n          <div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#74817b] mb-1.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-[#143d35]\\\">\\n                Pinpoint on Map (Click map or drag the pin):\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] text-[#74817b]\\\">\\n                Lat: {latitude.toFixed(5)}, Lng: {longitude.toFixed(5)}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <MapComponent\\n              isPickerMode={true}\\n              pickerLat={latitude}\\n              pickerLng={longitude}\\n              onPickerLocationChange={(lat, lng, label) => {\\n                setLatitude(lat);\\n                setLongitude(lng);\\n                if (label && (!locationLabel || locationLabel.trim().length < 4)) {\\n                  setLocationLabel(label);\\n                }\\n              }}\\n              height=\\\"340px\\\"\\n              zoomLevel={12}\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Section 4: Photograph Upload */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-3 pt-4 border-t border-[#e4e9e1]\\\">\\n          <label className=\\\"block text-sm font-bold text-[#143d35] font-manrope\\\">\\n            5. Attach Photograph (Optional)\\n          </label>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-[#74817b]\\\">\\n            Photos help community members and municipal coordinators verify the defect quickly.\\n          </p>\\n\\n          {imagePreview ? (\\n            <div className=\\\"relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#e4e9e1] max-h-64 bg-[#f6f7f3] flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n              <img\\n                src={imagePreview}\\n                alt=\\\"Upload preview\\\"\\n                className=\\\"max-h-64 w-full object-contain\\\"\\n              />\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setImagePreview(null)}\\n                className=\\\"absolute top-3 right-3 p-1.5 bg-[#143d35]/80 hover:bg-[#143d35] text-white rounded-full transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                title=\\\"Remove image\\\"\\n              >\\n                <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          ) : (\\n            <label className=\\\"border-2 border-dashed border-[#e4e9e1] hover:border-[#143d35] rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center cursor-pointer transition-colors bg-[#f6f7f3]/50 hover:bg-[#e8f1e9]/30\\\">\\n              <Upload className=\\\"w-7 h-7 text-[#74817b] mb-2\\\" />\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-[#143d35]\\\">\\n                Click to upload or drag photo here\\n              </p>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#74817b] mt-0.5\\\">\\n                PNG, JPG or WebP up to 5MB\\n              </p>\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"file\\\"\\n                accept=\\\"image/*\\\"\\n                onChange={handlePhotoUpload}\\n                className=\\\"hidden\\\"\\n              />\\n            </label>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Submit Button */}\\n        <div className=\\\"pt-4 border-t border-[#e4e9e1]\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n            disabled={isSubmitting}\\n            className=\\\"w-full py-4 px-6 rounded-xl bg-[#143d35] hover:bg-[#205347] active:scale-98 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-md shadow-[#143d35]/20 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n          >\\n            {isSubmitting ? (\\n              <>\\n                <RefreshCw className=\\\"w-4 h-4 animate-spin\\\" />\\n                <span>Saving Report to Cloud Firestore...</span>\\n              </>\\n            ) : (\\n              <>\\n                <Check className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#d7edbd]\\\" />\\n                <span>Save Report to FixMyRAK &rarr;</span>\\n              </>\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#74817b] text-center mt-2.5\\\">\\n            By submitting, you confirm the accuracy of the report. Reports are public for community awareness.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </form>\", \"StartLine\":300, \"TargetContent\":\"      {/* Main Form */}\\n      <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className=\\\"space-y-8 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md\\\">\\n        {/* Section 1: Problem Description & Gemini AI Assistant */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-sm font-black text-slate-900\\\">\\n              1. What is the issue? <span className=\\\"text-red-500\\\">*</span>\\n            </label>\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-400\\\">\\n              {description.length} characters\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <textarea\\n            required\\n            rows={4}\\n            value={description}\\n            onChange={(e) => setDescription(e.target.value)}\\n            placeholder=\\\"e.g. There is a deep pothole on the right lane near the roundabout leading towards Corniche Al Qawasim. Vehicles are swerving to avoid tire damage...\\\"\\n            className=\\\"w-full p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:outline-hidden bg-slate-50/50 leading-relaxed\\\"\\n          />\\n\\n          {/* AI Action Buttons Toolbar */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-1\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={handleAiCategorize}\\n              disabled={isCategorizing}\\n              className=\\\"px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-teal-50 hover:bg-teal-100 text-teal-800 text-xs font-bold border border-teal-200/80 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n            >\\n              {isCategorizing ? (\\n                <RefreshCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-spin\\\" />\\n              ) : (\\n                <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-teal-600\\\" />\\n              )}\\n              <span>AI Categorize & Suggest Title</span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={handleAiEnhance}\\n              disabled={isEnhancing}\\n              className=\\\"px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-sky-50 hover:bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 text-xs font-bold border border-sky-200/80 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n            >\\n              {isEnhancing ? (\\n                <RefreshCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-spin\\\" />\\n              ) : (\\n                <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-sky-600\\\" />\\n              )}\\n              <span>AI Polish Clarity</span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={handleCheckDuplicates}\\n              disabled={isCheckingDuplicates}\\n              className=\\\"px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 hover:bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 text-xs font-bold border border-purple-200/80 flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n            >\\n              {isCheckingDuplicates ? (\\n                <RefreshCw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 animate-spin\\\" />\\n              ) : (\\n                <Search className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-purple-600\\\" />\\n              )}\\n              <span>Check for Duplicates</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* AI Feedback Notices */}\\n          {aiCategorizeNotice && (\\n            <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200 rounded-xl text-xs text-teal-900 animate-in fade-in\\\">\\n              {aiCategorizeNotice}\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {aiEnhanceKeyPoints.length > 0 && (\\n            <div className=\\\"p-3 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200 rounded-xl text-xs text-sky-900 animate-in fade-in\\\">\\n              <p className=\\\"font-bold mb-1\\\">Key Extracted Points:</p>\\n              <ul className=\\\"list-disc list-inside space-y-0.5 text-sky-800\\\">\\n                {aiEnhanceKeyPoints.map((pt, idx) => (\\n                  <li key={idx}>{pt}</li>\\n                ))}\\n              </ul>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Duplicate check results card */}\\n          {duplicateCheckDone && (\\n            <div className=\\\"p-4 bg-purple-50/60 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl text-xs space-y-2 animate-in fade-in\\\">\\n              <p className=\\\"font-bold text-purple-950 flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                <Search className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-purple-600\\\" />\\n                Duplicate Detection Analysis:\\n              </p>\\n              {duplicateCandidates.length === 0 ? (\\n                <p className=\\\"text-purple-800\\\">\\n                  No matching reports found nearby. Your issue appears to be unique!\\n                </p>\\n              ) : (\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-2 pt-1\\\">\\n                  <p className=\\\"text-purple-800\\\">\\n                    We found {duplicateCandidates.length} potential existing report(s) describing similar concerns. Please verify if one of these matches your problem:\\n                  </p>\\n                  <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-purple-200/60 bg-white/80 rounded-xl border border-purple-200/60 p-2\\\">\\n                    {duplicateCandidates.map((dup) => {\\n                      const matchingReport = existingReports.find((r) => r.id === dup.reportId);\\n                      return (\\n                        <div key={dup.reportId} className=\\\"py-2 px-1\\\">\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-purple-900\\\">\\n                            <span>{matchingReport?.title || \'Report #\' + dup.reportId}</span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"text-[10px] bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\\\">\\n                              Match: {Math.round(dup.similarityScore * 100)}%\\n                            </span>\\n                          </div>\\n                          <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-purple-700 mt-0.5\\\">{dup.matchReason}</p>\\n                        </div>\\n                      );\\n                    })}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Section 2: Title and Category */}\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-sm font-black text-slate-900 mb-1.5\\\">\\n              2. Report Title <span className=\\\"text-red-500\\\">*</span>\\n            </label>\\n            <input\\n              type=\\\"text\\\"\\n              required\\n              minLength={3}\\n              maxLength={150}\\n              value={title}\\n              onChange={(e) => setTitle(e.target.value)}\\n              placeholder=\\\"e.g. Hazardous Pothole on Corniche Road\\\"\\n              className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:outline-hidden bg-slate-50/50\\\"\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-sm font-black text-slate-900 mb-1.5\\\">\\n              3. Category <span className=\\\"text-red-500\\\">*</span>\\n            </label>\\n            <select\\n              value={category}\\n              onChange={(e) => setCategory(e.target.value as ReportCategory)}\\n              className=\\\"w-full p-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:outline-hidden bg-slate-50/50 font-medium\\\"\\n            >\\n              {categories.map((cat) => (\\n                <option key={cat} value={cat}>\\n                  {cat}\\n                </option>\\n              ))}\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Section 3: Location Details & Interactive Map Picker */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-sm font-black text-slate-900 mb-1\\\">\\n              4. Location in Ras Al Khaimah <span className=\\\"text-red-500\\\">*</span>\\n            </label>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2\\\">\\n              Enter the street/neighborhood name and drop the pin precisely on the map below.\\n            </p>\\n            <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n              <MapPin className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 absolute left-3 top-3\\\" />\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                required\\n                value={locationLabel}\\n                onChange={(e) => setLocationLabel(e.target.value)}\\n                placeholder=\\\"e.g. Corniche Al Qawasim, near Al Fanar Restaurant\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500 focus:outline-hidden bg-slate-50/50\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Interactive Location Picker Map */}\\n          <div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-slate-700\\\">\\n                Pinpoint on Map (Click map or drag the blue pin):\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-600\\\">\\n                Lat: {latitude.toFixed(5)}, Lng: {longitude.toFixed(5)}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <MapComponent\\n              isPickerMode={true}\\n              pickerLat={latitude}\\n              pickerLng={longitude}\\n              onPickerLocationChange={(lat, lng, label) => {\\n                setLatitude(lat);\\n                setLongitude(lng);\\n                if (label && (!locationLabel || locationLabel.trim().length < 4)) {\\n                  setLocationLabel(label);\\n                }\\n              }}\\n              height=\\\"340px\\\"\\n              zoomLevel={12}\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Section 4: Photograph Upload */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n          <label className=\\\"block text-sm font-black text-slate-900\\\">\\n            5. Attach Photograph (Optional but Recommended)\\n          </label>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">\\n            Photos help municipal coordinators verify the defect and dispatch appropriate equipment.\\n          </p>\\n\\n          {imagePreview ? (\\n            <div className=\\\"relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 max-h-64 bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n              <img\\n                src={imagePreview}\\n                alt=\\\"Upload preview\\\"\\n                className=\\\"max-h-64 w-full object-contain\\\"\\n              />\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setImagePreview(null)}\\n                className=\\\"absolute top-3 right-3 p-1.5 bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-full transition-colors\\\"\\n                title=\\\"Remove image\\\"\\n              >\\n                <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          ) : (\\n            <label className=\\\"border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-500 rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center cursor-pointer transition-colors bg-slate-50/50 hover:bg-emerald-50/20\\\">\\n              <Upload className=\\\"w-8 h-8 text-slate-400 mb-2\\\" />\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-700\\\">\\n                Click to upload or drag photo here\\n              </p>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                PNG, JPG or WebP up to 5MB\\n              </p>\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"file\\\"\\n                accept=\\\"image/*\\\"\\n                onChange={handlePhotoUpload}\\n                className=\\\"hidden\\\"\\n              />\\n            </label>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Submit Button */}\\n        <div className=\\\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n            disabled={isSubmitting}\\n            className=\\\"w-full py-4 px-6 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 active:scale-98 text-white font-black text-sm shadow-md shadow-emerald-600/20 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\\\"\\n          >\\n            {isSubmitting ? (\\n              <>\\n                <RefreshCw className=\\\"w-5 h-5 animate-spin\\\" />\\n                <span>Saving Report to Cloud Firestore...</span>\\n              </>\\n            ) : (\\n              <>\\n                <Check className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n                <span>Submit Report to FixMyRAK</span>\\n              </>\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 text-center mt-2.5\\\">\\n            By submitting, you confirm the accuracy of the report. Reports are public for community awareness.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </form>\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/pages/ReportSubmissionPage.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating ReportSubmissionPage styles\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update form and buttons to match palette\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\255\a\n\252\a\001i\024}\023M}/2h\336\205-=-\255\250\n\257t\3229\261\200\302d\t\210\273\243\267\257\020\310[\276\316\003\036Z@\210\243L\212\360W\202\235\224\361.\001\341\336\355\346\256\032>E\376\324G\201\377\375W\211;\030\220iT\023\251\346Rtn}\271\020\020\332\223\004^\005qL\216Z\353\214\220p\006)\300\335\237,-\262\320\334\255D\331\227\340&ig\031\016v[4B\220\017\244\265q\315\337\363\206k\363\272_\330,\224\261n\346\024\305\311.y\006)\302%\272\274.D\343\200\275\200\226\005\231\020\021\250y&\315\314\213\204\337\226\351\246\b\365f}t*\2550{\307\366\vW\037s\177yw\266\271\306/\003{\333\275\241\265M\306;\207\033\220\"\311\333\345\215\020!\024\250\312\352qk2e\264e\001\353\3068e@a\203W\367\\\221)_~\227\335VI\377\320\342\376\346\375\027\347\222\212nB\216\200\330U_\265\256ZZ\260x\006\352\323\022Pw38\263\'9i\002t\3725\342\336\332\326\373\347\301\354.\362\375\036\030\345\310o\324\302\240A\202\n\224\n\r\224#[\216G.c\310m\026[\027\245\305\333\034\036\236\333\222RJ\356\000\362\216\374\021Q\261u,\017\035\"h\245\2545\247\320\001\355\371\330\346\240\342\206\017G\337\347\200\363\343\v\232\340\3233P\370\2365\3133\344I\273UL\276S\306\305\324\256\311\3776\207=\356\322&S?r`\252z\020\374P\3246\3724X\221\360\2777\'\2730m\336\257\217\372\330\345.\261\340\203\356:\n\202\303\307,\021\372\337\225\022\324\036\207\315\2260\1774\363\353RN\"Qj\272\315@;Z?\311\321\224\307\227\332\'\207\265,!\374|\016\321\2101\277\242\361\277\020>Es\373\203\336\\ \365\027\a\037\273\272\251\264\203F\257A\333\351\372|\207c\bV\021\2354\267\202\210\016~j\343\026\312j\203\300\376\206\346]A$*~6\337\274P\210\336&:\302\234\327\264\207\316\332$e7\301\276\354\204\001>\302JV\263\302\251\214\357V\251-\261\307\r\222h\303P\321\374\371D=\377d\"\030Ppt\360\000\244\023o\242\354\252\235\276_\247L\353Yr\fU]\361\255[\356\301\361\304\305fd\271\376\035\027\307`\317\354|C\241\210z\277\372\327uz]\202\375YK*\206\340c%C\265\207\253\20398\345\"I\262,\334\362\3767\372\271\271\372\236\246\203kc\240g\250&\357\364\a\32