  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Logo\'s Elements**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting this logo design. The map pin is cleverly used to represent Ras Al Khaimah\'s iconic landmarks. I find the incorporation of Jebel Jais, the shoreline, and the Dhayan Fort style fort tower quite effective. The winding road provides a great sense of place. I especially like the typography; the teal \"FixMy\" with the wrench icon contrasts well with the green \"RAK\", creating a professional, memorable look.\n\n\n"
