            }
            lines {
              text: "          <p>"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "            When you register, we collect your display name and email address via Firebase Authentication. When you submit a report, we store the problem title, description, attached photographs, and geographic location coordinates."
