            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "          <h3 className=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">2. Public vs. Private Data</h3>"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "          <p>"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "            Report descriptions, incident photographs, categories, and map coordinates are published openly to facilitate community awareness and municipal visibility. Your private email address is never displayed publicly."
