  planner_response {
    response: "The **FixMyRAK** logo has been integrated across the platform:\n\n### Where the Logo is Applied\n\n1. **Desktop & Tablet Navigation Bar (`Navbar.tsx`)**:\n   - Prominently positioned as the primary brand emblem on the top-left navigation, paired with the typography and UAE civic badge.\n2. **Mobile Navigation Drawer (`Navbar.tsx`)**:\n   - Branded drawer header featuring the logo and navigation links.\n3. **Footer Brand Lockup (`Footer.tsx`)**:\n   - Displayed alongside the brand name and the official tagline: *\"Your Community. Your Voice. A Better RAK.\"*\n4. **Browser Tab Favicon & Social Cards (`index.html`)**:\n   - Added as the browser tab favicon (`<link rel=\"icon\">`) as well as the `og:image` and `twitter:image` share preview cards.\n5. **Sign-In & Registration Modal (`AuthModal.tsx`)**:\n   - Centered above the modal header to welcome residents and community members.\n6. **Report Submission Wizard (`ReportSubmissionPage.tsx`)**:\n   - Embedded atop the reporting wizard as a community stamp.\n7. **About & Transparency Page (`AboutPage.tsx`)**:\n   - Featured in the mission overview header."
    thinking: "**Verifying Logo Integration**\n\nI\'ve confirmed a successful retrieval of the logo asset, receiving a 200 OK response with the correct PNG content type and size. Now, I\'m meticulously auditing all areas where the logo is integrated, starting with the desktop navbar component to ensure its proper rendering and functionality. I\'m focusing on those touchpoints to make sure they are correct.\n\n\n"
