  planner_response {
    response: "**No, not at all! It will NOT cost you any money.**\n\nEverything currently powering **FixMyRAK is 100% free**:\n\n### 1. The Map (Leaflet + OpenStreetMap)\n* **Cost**: **$0.00 (Free forever)**\n* Open-source and community-hosted.\n* **No credit card, no billing account, no subscription, and no hidden fees.**\n\n### 2. Firebase (Firestore & Authentication)\n* **Cost**: **$0.00 on the Free \"Spark\" Plan**\n* Includes:\n  * **50,000 free document reads per day**\n  * **20,000 free document writes per day**\n  * **Unlimited free user authentication accounts**\n* Firebase\'s free tier does not charge you unless you explicitly enter billing details and upgrade to the Blaze plan.\n\n### 3. AI Studio & Gemini AI\n* The Gemini 3.8 Flash model calls and AI Studio environment operate under the standard free development tier.\n\n---\n\n### Recommendation\n**Keep the current Leaflet map!** It looks clean, runs fast, pins all your Ras Al Khaimah locations accurately, and gives you complete peace of mind with **zero cost**."
    thinking: "**Clarifying Project Costs**\n\nI\'ve got a handle on the cost question! It looks like there\'s some concern about expenses, so I\'m focusing on providing complete clarity. I\'ve broken down the costs, and I\'m happy to report that the current map setup, using Leaflet, OpenStreetMap, and CartoDB, is completely free!\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "**No, not at all! It will NOT cost you any money.**\n\nEverything currently powering **FixMyRAK is 100% free**:\n\n### 1. The Map (Leaflet + OpenStreetMap)\n* **Cost**: **$0.00 (Free forever)**\n* Open-source and community-hosted.\n* **No credit card, no billing account, no subscription, and no hidden fees.**\n\n### 2. Firebase (Firestore & Authentication)\n* **Cost**: **$0.00 on the Free \"Spark\" Plan**\n* Includes:\n  * **50,000 free document reads per day**\n  * **20,000 free document writes per day**\n  * **Unlimited free user authentication accounts**\n* Firebase\'s free tier does not charge you unless you explicitly enter billing details and upgrade to the Blaze plan.\n\n### 3. AI Studio & Gemini AI\n* The Gemini 3.8 Flash model calls and AI Studio environment operate under the standard free development tier.\n\n---\n\n### Recommendation\n**Keep the current Leaflet map!** It looks clean, runs fast, pins all your Ras Al Khaimah locations accurately, and gives you complete peace of mind with **zero cost**."
