    summary: "**CARTO basemaps (including Voyager, Positron, and Dark Matter) require an API key[1].** \n\nIf you attempt to load a CARTO raster tile layer in Leaflet without a key, your map will fail to load the streets/labels and will instead display tiles reading **\"API KEY REQUIRED\"**[2].\n\n### How to fix it:\n\n1. **Get a free API key:** \n   You can request a key instantly by visiting the [CARTO Basemaps API Key page](https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/)[3][4]. It is free for non-commercial use (up to 5 million requests/month) and light commercial use (up to 1 million requests/month)[5].\n\n2. **Update your Leaflet code:**\n   Append `?key=YOUR_API_KEY` to the end of your CARTO tile layer URL[6]. \n\n#### Example implementation for Leaflet:\n\n```javascript\n// Define your API key\nconst apiKey = \'YOUR_CARTO_API_KEY\';\n\n// Add the Voyager tile layer with the key parameter\nconst voyagerLayer = L.tileLayer(\'https://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}{r}.png?key=\' + apiKey, {\n    attribution: \'&copy; <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors &copy; <a href=\"https://carto.com/attributions\">CARTO</a>\',\n    subdomains: \'abcd\',\n    maxZoom: 20\n});\n\n// Add it to your Leaflet map\nconst map = L.map(\'map\', {\n    center: [45.5152, -122.6784],\n    zoom: 13,\n    layers: [voyagerLayer]\n});\n```\n\nSources:\n[1] [saas-glue.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGLM9Ky-cpsAwFYuxVNj65mtgsVlWgXayYt8H7CNN8owZXwo1VXO_mt7WrM1JVqgWeKzbWYeHl962bTQUPUqfezMlqpmQt_M-dnALBxKqS3q1qBBEFNJA==)\n[2] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHYMQLBqdQKdg6aboXECv_qvfpbHHx8-Rq2rUCe1zrmJTN28E1sq01DrRsmfMMmkHYye_Vwyarc-GOAhTZXzoG16miIotpM3RXHcCVvQ9RDjEPpylMSBihw4q48evrBpw==)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHeKTxKzI1PQumVA54b5vpW2DdPw5N6ajOFrMAdymv9mvuZmWRi51h_qKKcjiagzW0lTRbuqyJ9z6RpCJlIX4IZGKe4XONZfdR9tnIPgQw9S99Rq6JKTSGLXp9w7rRU)\n[4] [home-assistant.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHTEfFmx_zMSlg3InpfcvoK-yJLk8scdCOyHpyO6TeKgyWZFHWg4lJFU714NpgGMy7Yh4Yfr_UCopWFzJ7HBzgm5jd4pe3D6rwpW-FzAoF_RNKQsAnnAGCWMWdLkbVrVmL1IZzwRKNTJ1CreU8MXwsJ_nkLV-uJXTt6UpoTCFZraIoWkbYpfzKn)\n[5] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFjmc_jB0IOPydNENj6oalwIOHnWbGgNREj2jHK7xBrCA_MhTccqqd6ACEsomyEx5VsYnyDV9KnVMdxep1fXNrQTgPc-LN1kKqGTAxgvhGRhdqi0FX5Rkw=)\n[6] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFjmc_jB0IOPydNENj6oalwIOHnWbGgNREj2jHK7xBrCA_MhTccqqd6ACEsomyEx5VsYnyDV9KnVMdxep1fXNrQTgPc-LN1kKqGTAxgvhGRhdqi0FX5Rkw=)"
