    summary: "CARTO enforces a policy where **raster tile endpoints require an API key**[1]. Requests made without a key will return tiles watermarked with *\"API KEY REQUIRED\"*[2]. \n\nHowever, getting a **free API key** takes less than a minute, requires no credit card, and does not require a full CARTO account[3][4]. Alternatively, if you want a map style that works completely without an API key, there are drop-in alternatives[5].\n\n---\n\n### Option 1: Get the Official Free CARTO API Key (Recommended)\nCARTO provides a generous free tier for developers and non-commercial use (up to **5 million requests per month** for non-commercial, and 1 million for commercial)[1].\n\n1. Request your free key instantly at [carto.com/basemaps/apikey](https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/)[1].\n2. Append `?key=YOUR_KEY` to your Leaflet `L.tileLayer` URL[2][6]:\n\n```javascript\nconst voyagerLayer = L.tileLayer(\'https://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}{r}.png?key=YOUR_KEY\', {\n    attribution: \'&copy; <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors &copy; <a href=\"https://carto.com/attributions\">CARTO</a>\',\n    subdomains: \'abcd\',\n    maxZoom: 20\n}).addTo(map);\n```\n\n---\n\n### Option 2: Free Alternatives (No API Key / No Sign-up Required)\nIf you need a tile layer that works immediately without registering for an API key, consider these options styled similarly to CARTO\'s clean aesthetic:\n\n#### 1. OpenFreeMap (Vector/Raster styles close to CARTO)\nOpenFreeMap provides free map tiles powered by OpenStreetMap with **no API key, no sign-up, and no request limits**[5][7]. While native rendering uses MapLibre GL, they offer compatible raster rendering options or can be swapped seamlessly in many dashboard frameworks[5].\n\n#### 2. Standard OpenStreetMap Raster Tiles\nIf you just want a standard, completely free raster background with zero configuration in Leaflet[8]:\n\n```javascript\nconst osmLayer = L.tileLayer(\'https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png\', {\n    maxZoom: 19,\n    attribution: \'&copy; <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors\'\n}).addTo(map);\n```\n\n#### 3. Stamen / Stadia Maps (Stamen Toner / Watercolor / Terrain)\nIf you liked CARTO for its minimalist design, Stadia Maps hosts the classic Stamen designs. (Note: Stadia requires a free registration for production use, but offers permissive free tiers).\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH_OEK22RZuaFux-8aoxx0Pqsd7I77JdbkNkDzYSYykTp9Xyx8EPGfpzteixzEEJbq6Mdh6l9deU7tXNcINBTCM8TrV1glldGxNHy4M7vvIprAeUOzJjR-vvw00_tDG)\n[2] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFSdRrbEG8awZS3c0txaB-fVQ2kjBF9v3JGcLaBscnSeCAVGUK-yfgTJQRC_5kOfQJD7twUeWTTCY8w0ZYscDZpxZg_3FjCH0XkavC766L9ELRl1uzrrHr7wXYLI7Oncw==)\n[3] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEkKOTbPLmdasQWGyoPV8bFR7VTUe5wNHlSOjHnaXsRYJ7QtNbNNJCWOE1H4BtCvghpRsfJfmBhdE665Cm4eAbXoqmPL_h803OKK-EE8YT3riO93R7cFk8=)\n[4] [latlng.work](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHWZntCtnm7K9b6LxI172uyEqjuhYe6KtzWZE1LWJ0CEqM_CMMfNwJ5A7XmLfB3aBiCBFCc5X70wN0Yz33aaKJ_OOUt0gBLMymQkroRBa7EG1NXJUHEm1hCA5S0nlq9)\n[5] [hhf.technology](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGI9XQhzLHQJpEbTgqTuqP9VgvTFWTWbNCWRG_MuQ0DGzjxBbksSYjXmB_o4Kk4k6oSILsvPgN_nRrH84nCuj8trruWzeGfzPNLdVdFjqS6e8t2CV9aUE7Byp1WT-G-G6aBOX15Wfooeyu2CqNWdxvchO992Hz-fR9UAEttt8AHsydKkZ7sYYxV5hx4eu4UnnaP5DHO7RTewYT-Oj0H4_rDbFDpEgTCTiaoPlZXPCsW6lKW5-qPzCMn36ZVc9xTCefwXIiRv5MYc6e8-hGu)\n[6] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFSdRrbEG8awZS3c0txaB-fVQ2kjBF9v3JGcLaBscnSeCAVGUK-yfgTJQRC_5kOfQJD7twUeWTTCY8w0ZYscDZpxZg_3FjCH0XkavC766L9ELRl1uzrrHr7wXYLI7Oncw==)\n[7] [maptoolkit.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGZ4jdAGBzUMpB3YjYLYu4VdOfpjHDKOXeB2i8dehFCrkl_TG_2Z989kSg9T14D6Rlhw5MM6EbxEIZPtXSmDazX3xcrLxr1kj9aPiojijNhVQ==)\n[8] [openstreetmap.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFZy6FAnkaCm-jRdXqgVVQ1TSYu88nH987KWPAWPJXHbJyuW1J9czw6b1Qc95Z01BovO_jB5H-U4xA1Ro7svTXzpsQbzjmoI3yGbj1WaPov2cz2_MSbYNZd881FlrBH7_r2Ypm3OOJ4InBCbbBpTQ==)"
