      title: "github.com"
    }
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGsI1juDwzqFaqAbnrl7s-53Mf8PMYG_4VyJPy5k631F0uAokImfAzqJCAaHOiG9v16etuJFDT9G4sYucdP2zKM3UbC3ZMTcCVwApIXhyN57rcBScAHp4o6"
      title: "carto.com"
    }
    summary: "CARTO requires a free API key for all raster tile basemap requests (such as `voyager`, `positron`, and `dark_all`)[1][2]. Requests made without a key will display an `\"API KEY REQUIRED\"` watermark directly on the map tiles[3].\n\nTo fix or set this up in your mapping application (like Leaflet, OpenLayers, or custom XYZ tile layers), append your acquired API key to the end of the URL string[4]:\n\n```text\nhttps://basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_API_KEY\n```\n\n### How to get a key:\n1. Go to the [CARTO Basemaps API Key page](https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/)[1].\n2. Request a free API key (it is free up to a generous monthly quota for non-commercial/standard uses and doesn\'t require a full paid CARTO account)[2].\n3. Replace `YOUR_API_KEY` in your tile layer configuration URL with the key provided[4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEE7tOUaiEVzgN3zQsT4fg8whNIFUlgl7rCI9Hfz-xaWs9gKRvWyqT0LqIum2Jl-kIJAJjyYw0nLyRR1sBs0Oo064Gd0aM6gwhBMWATio1wqD5RsLj3TTPG75_ffPGwyA==)\n[2] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHHR4MWOVRjmJVZXGwG-wTJijnDcSE6JBf1ndDqvvHR-PPlt2Uma1KCtJ0_yYlT9DbJBYyLfFtRKmouXTmfViZW6x9RIgVelv4_9yJOXYPMIPD5tKFCoXOE1ZmMSopGn_Jf)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHVHcaC_sluP_KYrO0PtsyubgRGsRuN9dkNopKD-SPXnQYUXPLxVaMOI5ZGYu2Ld8My-GQw3Ii37Tdtw7fkuGDDcNeXXbFUXKrygguV2iguaGMBXYAxKd9kKaqgzlp1ArsV9lWhrsz6NOpGpMT_nRQf_UGD0pllIw==)\n[4] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGsI1juDwzqFaqAbnrl7s-53Mf8PMYG_4VyJPy5k631F0uAokImfAzqJCAaHOiG9v16etuJFDT9G4sYucdP2zKM3UbC3ZMTcCVwApIXhyN57rcBScAHp4o6)"
