    summary: "Based on CARTO\'s basemap updates and related GitHub issues[1], anonymous or keyless requests to CARTO raster tile endpoints (such as `basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager`) return tiles marked with an \"API KEY REQUIRED\" watermark[1]. \n\nTo fix this, you must append your free CARTO API key to the tile URL using the `?key=` parameter[2][1]:\n\n```text\nhttps://basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_KEY\n```\n*(or with retina support: `https://basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}@2x.png?key=YOUR_KEY`[3])*\n\n### How to get a key:\n* You can sign up for a free API key at [carto.com/basemaps/apikey](https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/)[2]. \n* Free tiers cover non-commercial and limited commercial usage[2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQdHkcw7VTBQ5S8qXgfPdN39z75x8mns7ujvjW6JzFEndRApNov0ZxUMwVBDWu8qGOwoREeB7WofKBiXy7JF53PWUCMkfsTvvfajU8gSi9hUWumzaNaysf52_bDmzXU0yhmqUm0m-6IJSCDSFw7E0kfk9zrznFyg==)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFbtauV5bVCXD1pODYSqxEuyJzt44OpOhT-mm_I3S9WqUUMpc0PkN2QqUwAccNC5J2xHVZzZCtT2tKD43CxLYcFCHbCP7Fa2rmealP-TB5SN5vov8QeyDJ6LvjBJA6dBA==)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFbtauV5bVCXD1pODYSqxEuyJzt44OpOhT-mm_I3S9WqUUMpc0PkN2QqUwAccNC5J2xHVZzZCtT2tKD43CxLYcFCHbCP7Fa2rmealP-TB5SN5vov8QeyDJ6LvjBJA6dBA==)"
