      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFXkK1B7QYp6Sl80h757e-ZBr1Y8u4bYH5t4nHzpjJoMu8lUIpFzVmaGZXCS1ug2PETQg6bWob11FKhyGt4-Io3qHLToCzW4YOK8GAU44IiB97FY1a7hS31VosbnukFo1PhjKWqmMbwNb-51_S-8Z76fHOBMUWVDvl3CV__fiEXQRc3fMRmIZEqji_7ztkyadUT-0c1LrC8YmX1Pa1QJOjRTIr9ZQTtM26TaXLLa_bEeHMHzJg1dRjqBKlfpSXazUygxbxKj_Yuw_MP"
      title: "hhf.technology"
    }
    summary: "The query results point to the official CARTO repository and documentation regarding CARTO basemaps (such as `rastertiles/voyager`) on GitHub[1][2]. \n\n### Key Information from GitHub on CARTO Basemaps & API Keys:\n\n* **API Key Requirement:** CARTO requires a free API key for accessing its basemap tiles (both raster and vector)[3][4]. Requests made without a key will display an `\"API KEY REQUIRED\"` watermark[5][2].\n* **Free Tier:** A free tier is available for non-commercial use (up to a certain monthly limit of tile requests)[6]. You can register for a key at [carto.com/basemaps/apikey](https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/)[3][6].\n* **URL Structure:** The API key must be appended as a parameter (`?key=YOUR_KEY` or `&key=YOUR_KEY`) to the tile layer URL[4][6]:\n\n```javascript\n// Example for Leaflet JS using the raster Voyager tile layer\nconst layer = L.tileLayer(\'https://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_KEY\', {\n    attribution: \'&copy; <a href=\"http://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OpenStreetMap</a>, &copy; <a href=\"https://carto.com/attributions\">CARTO</a>\',\n    subdomains: \'abcd\',\n    maxZoom: 20\n});\n```\n\n* **Deprecation Notice:** CARTO has been encouraging developers to migrate from older raster tile endpoints (like `rastertiles/voyager`) to newer vector-based styles (like MapLibre GL JS implementations) for sharper rendering and better performance, though your single API key works for both[3][7][2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEe_s8e6lAbsbOpYFErlTpYT95iZr55zffqBLmOTpZ3C05x2nsYl4iTzOyL8Pv1DMf6zQihHWMdndvCkcTwPq_aOzVnh6oqtb7FcGQ1o_UtRfH2PITfEZeWKYecEbS)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEe_s8e6lAbsbOpYFErlTpYT95iZr55zffqBLmOTpZ3C05x2nsYl4iTzOyL8Pv1DMf6zQihHWMdndvCkcTwPq_aOzVnh6oqtb7FcGQ1o_UtRfH2PITfEZeWKYecEbS)\n[3] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHrglO43eHHcw4yegr-khZm61jj6qUMKq2vRaIHF3DOBYQO6UTn0HHcSP7B_QGu_u3T8-cM0o-OXFx11_fMWjl8OX8UkMDjTPgKtFBVXD_uu7POl8VGVao=)\n[4] [handsondataviz.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEW-NxhYppuA4GXFs2rm7H-ecIUdO45aYrY-1EYF9nPKLh6YXNf4b6NoAk0DmX-ZGR7W27u9KOhSRX53t88KbfRPBeHuA7ygH6pyxi01V1VVb-FPS3eWRe81the5KwGfks65cnSL8_SckgDcg==)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEb_0x3Qgd9b76hlTepg2_A_iHWi56YxalJq3fbCOyfWqvnpTOQsQP8CrVx9B-OUNnVY-S14_neFyiTeVG4_nsY-tklqCRX6GBiMdnZTX2SPjZjfxswNi4a_InWf5CqPDnNLyqUAO8jfYo=)\n[6] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF9ZzQznvc54pV7JdBSdSmaxh6wGbnRcKLE3-C9qtujpjibx3PkeHbYCKwRl_ySAEfOIfqn-xgTAKb0vy0MJEXotj36vXwXmbIDY6-D8fPIIBAatl6FixVVfSbsPDdjS_c=)\n[7] [hhf.technology](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFXkK1B7QYp6Sl80h757e-ZBr1Y8u4bYH5t4nHzpjJoMu8lUIpFzVmaGZXCS1ug2PETQg6bWob11FKhyGt4-Io3qHLToCzW4YOK8GAU44IiB97FY1a7hS31VosbnukFo1PhjKWqmMbwNb-51_S-8Z76fHOBMUWVDvl3CV__fiEXQRc3fMRmIZEqji_7ztkyadUT-0c1LrC8YmX1Pa1QJOjRTIr9ZQTtM26TaXLLa_bEeHMHzJg1dRjqBKlfpSXazUygxbxKj_Yuw_MP)"
