    summary: "This string refers to the URL structure used for **CARTO Basemaps** (specifically the raster tile format for the \"Voyager\" map style)[1][2]. \n\n### Overview\n* **URL Format:** `https://basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_KEY`[1]\n* **Purpose:** Used in mapping libraries like Leaflet[2][3], OpenLayers[2], or dashboard tools (such as Grafana)[4] to load clean, styled background map tiles[5].\n\n### Important Update Regarding API Keys\nCARTO requires a **free API key** for raster tile requests[5][3]. If an API key is omitted from the URL request, maps using these raster tiles will display an **\"API KEY REQUIRED\"** watermark across the background[1][4][3].\n\n### How to Fix the Watermark / Get a Key:\n1. **Request a Key:** You can sign up for a free, no-credit-card-required API key at the [CARTO Basemaps API Key page](https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/)[1][3].\n2. **Update your URL:** Append `?key=YOUR_API_KEY` to the end of your tile layer URL template[1][2][3]:\n   ```text\n   https://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_ACTUAL_KEY\n   ```\n\nSources:\n[1] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFS3SVJwoClhQuiVmxflgHrcSGZLpknZP5KWABrEp3pvYs02LbGYvv2Fwy8gUpzD4IAt86Y6e0UjnidwuOa-3u5UtjemLsYpQI0WG7F1WcnDv5Fbj1ewVh8)\n[2] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTTfCJH2hyX1Ft47WU0Am6SqqrssjMZDBG6TeB_G_z74OSqbY2RAp94qbyXs7lsQxFyLxoRNCUjlXTo5OKCB-cqncqWb1koxawxscR4hvKfF4=)\n[3] [handsondataviz.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEn3XW_-imiGXTbHmML088oTXiX6QTeLJouWkDU4a06pcrGxVarLif0Y1ODSU5djE0pzwH9UEhUuokye5vA2nE8sBZ3_QogFrIOdxKbpqy14bK9YA5MgoUlFC0KWjlbA9-SjuTUVjrPy6XDgkw=)\n[4] [grafana.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFcj0C4jUGwzKMnFgSEL4UPXsZcrh6BdwQJy7h3CTakhjIp00c0PZts_YTuACXw5vaZychNNkS7HYhg0ft9plCRBfnSC2IuA9VvDwlyy2OEVc-DjI3scZ510rW1aPDYOxpneF6HVK-J54o-ny6HLSa3VyLD8GvnosbYhP6f1KhJroOdi2SVPlrM)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFqq2WxGw-Zhv6a7ZBh2WMzN27TagCX-hagm3bwRZupBfjmwyRqILg6aEdbB4KlU58Y_5P9pr1loF7VF9QXy18tTLmR6Mv-tqtxw-RFg-hSxMFuC_CSf-xHIBkdGNQY_w==)"
