    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH3KrQtOARZKjJlnc3mJ90yn14VaK3-VuUE2Vzi95bBjIvvIt0SoyvrNV_nB0PBcUTPDcouvBYx2WA_J2XURUhxTIl_mJXnupPqejuRp-rht0JBVNcqMS2AhcCseUtB2l-_DEybig=="
      title: "xga.ie"
    }
    summary: "CARTO requires an API key for all raster tile requests (`basemaps.cartocdn.com`), which causes an **\"API KEY REQUIRED\"** watermark to appear on Grafana Geomap panels using the built-in CARTO basemaps[1][2]. \n\nTo fix this and use the **Voyager** style with your own API key, follow these steps:\n\n### 1. Get a Free CARTO API Key\n1. Go to [carto.com/basemaps/apikey](https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey)[3].\n2. Request a free key (free tiers typically allow up to 5 million requests per month, which is plenty for internal or low-traffic dashboards)[4][3].\n3. Copy the API key sent to your email[2].\n\n### 2. Configure Grafana Geomap\nSince Grafana\'s default CARTO layer option doesn\'t include a field to input an API key[2], you need to override it using a custom XYZ/ArcGIS tile layer[1][2]:\n\n1. Open your Grafana dashboard and **Edit** the Geomap panel[2].\n2. Scroll down to the **Basemap layer** configuration settings[2].\n3. Change the **Layer type** to **`ArcGIS MapServer`** (or `XYZ Tile layer` depending on your Grafana version)[1][2].\n4. Set the Server Instance / Layer Source to **Custom MapServer**[1][4].\n5. In the **URL Template** field, paste the following URL (appending your key)[2]:\n   ```text\n   https://basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_API_KEY\n   ```\n   *(Replace `YOUR_API_KEY` with the actual key you received from CARTO).*\n6. Set the **Attribution** field to `carto.com` (or OpenStreetMap/CARTO attribution)[2][4].\n\nYour Voyager map tiles will load properly, and the watermark will disappear[2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [grafana.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH488Ji_cteu-b5Tr85L9HR2UQN9cmLJPX8Fx_uuFqZ1TUsOz_6ivDF8RZHo3SZvJjR9wXCVlTkfNYWQlJQ_s54ihPowqPAmkkg59TtYv0Qzc229Daw_2NN3t1JfjlFjCf_fH9UCLwWXmhN1Gj_-PwMarukjcv_5qIoHu4ojZKckf6iTSMQnyZo)\n[2] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHpM8dUhDkRnNrlfwuWFhvqorUcBmo3BfoIk_BkCmkB3E7DisVQ1_fsCEcHOaxueodLVOoSsIRD7_PM7qWORFRqDyysq8wqbmWXyr1hHBksmzSLEaU5S5Q4)\n[3] [carto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFbzcSPJAq6rbWUyOV8EnzNFeLKBwbx7IyDB4JIWfcmRcPF0aPbKYAPmEk9EzuAQpubHhNLVVDQc9vfSSJUWTXtkZe2fehHX1XS_z-n1fZ-3uYCg58dOe_IHNoeIyEPYiniiHgY7VSFG611kogm24s6m4vn_sUr72ppNMpFa1iRoaeMBsp7Cp6wKQzUbHC_Eu7_m-GI9j61)\n[4] [xga.ie](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH3KrQtOARZKjJlnc3mJ90yn14VaK3-VuUE2Vzi95bBjIvvIt0SoyvrNV_nB0PBcUTPDcouvBYx2WA_J2XURUhxTIl_mJXnupPqejuRp-rht0JBVNcqMS2AhcCseUtB2l-_DEybig==)"
