  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Map Integration**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `MapComponent.tsx` file. My goal is to streamline the map integration by exclusively using Voyager tiles and managing the `cartoKey` with state initialized from `localStorage`. I\'m exploring the implications of replacing the existing `mapStyle` state with this approach, ensuring it doesn\'t break any functionality.\n\n\n**Implementing CartoKey Integration**\n\nI\'ve made progress integrating the `cartoKey`. I\'m now dynamically constructing the tile URL using the `cartoKey` from `localStorage`, ensuring it\'s included as a query parameter. I\'m also ensuring the old tile layer is properly removed and replaced whenever the `cartoKey` changes. My next focus is on managing the `showKeyModal` state and how it impacts the overall flow.\n\n\n**Streamlining Tile Display**\n\nI\'ve transitioned to exclusively using Voyager tiles and removed the \"Standard Tiles\" option, streamlining the map interface. The button is now styled with our custom palette and triggers a modal. I am updating `cartoKey` for tile display.\n\n\n"
