  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refactoring Map Styling**\n\nI\'m currently working on refactoring the map styling. My plan involves replacing the `useState` approach with `useRef` and `useState` hooks to manage tile layer references and modal visibility. I\'m also adding a state variable for the Carto key. This seems like a promising direction for more efficient control.\n\n\n**Updating Carto Key Handling**\n\nI\'ve made progress on the Carto key management. I\'ve built a utility function `buildVoyagerUrl` and now the tile layer uses the Carto key from local storage. I\'m also adding a `useEffect` hook to update the tile layer URL whenever the key changes. Now I am trying to remove and re-add the layer to the map to ensure it\'s re-rendered with the new key.\n\n\n"
