  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Button Code**\n\nI\'ve been examining the code snippet, specifically focusing on button 3 (lines 276-282). I see it toggles the map style between \'light\' and \'standard\' when clicked. My understanding is that this likely controls the visual appearance of the map displayed to the user. I plan to dig further to see if there are side effects of this style change.\n\n\n**Refactoring Button Functionality**\n\nI\'ve replaced the third button\'s code with the new code to exclusively show voyager tiles. I\'ve also integrated a CARTO API key modal, which is now triggered by this button. My focus is now on ensuring the visual elements and behavior of this button are correct, as well as the functionality of the modal it calls.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_63926"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Set Voyager tiles exclusively and add tileLayerRef and key state\", \"EndLine\":68, \"Instruction\":\"Replace mapStyle state and tileUrl with exclusive Voyager tile configuration\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const tileLayerRef = useRef<L.TileLayer | null>(null);\\n  const [showKeyModal, setShowKeyModal] = useState(false);\\n  const [cartoKey, setCartoKey] = useState<string>(() => {\\n    return localStorage.getItem(\'fixmyrak_carto_key\') || \'\';\\n  });\\n  const [inputKey, setInputKey] = useState(cartoKey);\\n\\n  // Initialize Map with Voyager Tiles exclusively\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!mapContainerRef.current) return;\\n    if (mapInstanceRef.current) return; // Already initialized\\n\\n    const initialLat = isPickerMode ? pickerLat : 25.7895;\\n    const initialLng = isPickerMode ? pickerLng : 55.9432;\\n\\n    const map = L.map(mapContainerRef.current, {\\n      center: [initialLat, initialLng],\\n      zoom: zoomLevel,\\n      zoomControl: false,\\n    });\\n\\n    L.control.zoom({ position: \'bottomright\' }).addTo(map);\\n\\n    const trimmedKey = cartoKey.trim();\\n    const tileUrl = `https://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/rastertiles/voyager/{z}/{x}/{y}{r}.png${trimmedKey ? `?key=${trimmedKey}` : \'\'}`;\\n    const attribution = \'&copy; <a href=\\\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\\\">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors &copy; <a href=\\\"https://carto.com/attributions\\\">CARTO</a>\';\\n\\n    const baseTileLayer = L.tileLayer(tileUrl, {\\n      attribution,\\n      maxZoom: 19,\\n      subdomains: \'abcd\',\\n    }).addTo(map);\\n\\n    tileLayerRef.current = baseTileLayer;\\n    mapInstanceRef.current = map;\\n    markersLayerRef.current = L.layerGroup().addTo(map);\", \"StartLine\":34, \"TargetContent\":\"  const [mapStyle, setMapStyle] = useState<\'standard\' | \'light\'>(\'light\');\\n\\n  // Initialize Map\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!mapContainerRef.current) return;\\