  planner_response {
    response: "**Yes, absolutely!** It will work for everyone, on every device and account.\n\nHere is why:\n\n1. **Baked directly into the website**: The CARTO key (`cb1_4yxz_1_3649369b315d6468ddfd0217`) is hardcoded as the default in the application code. Anyone who visits the site\342\200\224whether on a phone, tablet, laptop, or desktop, whether logged in or out\342\200\224automatically loads the map with your key. They will never have to enter or configure anything.\n2. **Clean & watermark-free**: The \"API KEY REQUIRED\" watermark is gone. CARTO Voyager tiles load crisp and clear across all pages (Home page, Report Submission pin-picker, and the Interactive Map).\n3. **100% Free**: CARTO\'s basemap tier provides up to **5,000,000 map tile views per month for $0.00**, so you won\'t be charged anything."
