  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing User-Centric Features**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the user experience. I\'m prioritizing the implementation of a search bar for the ExploreReportsPage, enabling filtering by description, location, or reporter name. I\'m also addressing the \"My Reports\" bar, improving the map functionality, and exploring translation features.\n\n\n**Analyzing Navigation Architecture**\n\nI\'ve been examining the \"My Reports\" functionality more closely, and it\'s clear the design is not ideal. I\'ve pinpointed that \"My Reports\" is buried within the user profile dropdown, and absent when signed out. I am now considering ways to make this more accessible across different states and pages, like including a tab on the `ExploreReportsPage`.\n\n\n"
