  planner_response {
    response: "Here are all the major upgrades implemented across **FixMyRAK**:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Multi-Field Search Bar on Explore Reports\n- **Multi-Field Filtering**: Users can filter reports across **Description**, **Location**, or **Reporter Name** (or select **All Fields** to search across every attribute).\n- **Target Filter Buttons**: Easily toggle between `[All Fields]`, `[Description]`, `[Location]`, and `[Reporter Name]` right from the search bar.\n- **Match Reason Tagging**: When a search is performed, cards show which attribute matched (e.g., `\360\237\223\215 Matched Location: Corniche Al Qawasim` or `\360\237\221\244 Reporter: Fatima Al Mansoori`).\n- **Quick Suggested Searches**: One-click tags for popular RAK locations and keywords (`Corniche Al Qawasim`, `Al Hamra Marina`, `Khuzam`, `Fatima Al Mansoori`, `Pothole`).\n- **Instant Clear & Results Count**: Live count with a 1-click `Clear all filters` button.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Fixed & Elevated \"My Reports\" Bar\n- **Direct Navigation Tab**: Added **\"My Reports\"** directly to the main desktop navbar and mobile menu with a live badge showing how many reports you\'ve submitted.\n- **Explore Page Switcher**: Added an `[All Community Reports] | [My Reports Only]` toggle bar directly above the report feed.\n- **Dedicated Search within My Reports**: Users can quickly search their own submissions by keyword, street, or status.\n- **4-Step Municipal Progress Bar**: Each submitted report shows a visual progression bar (`1. Submitted` \342\206\222 `2. Under Review` \342\206\222 `3. In Progress` \342\206\222 `4. Resolved`) so citizens can track exact city action at a glance.\n- **\"Show on Map\" Action**: Each report card has a direct \"Show on Map\" button that immediately flies to and highlights that defect on the map.\n- **Guest-Friendly**: If browsing without signing in, visitors see a preview of how tracking works, with a quick sign-in prompt.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Translation Feature (English & Arabic)\n- **Language Switcher**: Added a language switcher (`\360\237\207\254\360\237\207\247 English / \360\237\207\246\360\237\207\252 \330\247\331\204\330\271\330\261\330\250\331\212\330\251`) in the top navigation bar and mobile drawer.\n- **Full UI Localization**: Navigation links, report statuses, categories, search placeholders, district names, and actions switch between English and Arabic.\n- **AI Report Translation**: Added a **\"Translate Report\"** button inside the report details modal. Clicking it instantly translates the report description between English and Arabic (powered by Gemini with a resilient fallback).\n\n---\n\n### 4. 100x Better Interactive Map Experience\n- **CARTO Voyager Basemap**: Active, crisp, and watermark-free with your key.\n- **Quick District Jump Bar**: Floating shortcuts to smoothly fly the camera to key RAK districts: **All RAK**, **Corniche Al Qawasim**, **Al Nakheel**, **Al Hamra**, **Mina Al Arab**, **Khuzam**, and **Jebel Jais**.\n- **Interactive Map Search**: Search any report pin or landmark right on top of the map.\n- **Rich Interactive Leaflet Popups**: Clicking any pin opens a card with the photo thumbnail, status badge, category, date, and a clickable **\"View Details\"** button.\n- **Floating Status Filter Pills**: Filter map pins directly on the map (`All`, `Submitted`, `Under Review`, `In Progress`, `Resolved`).\n- **Map Tools**:\n  - **\"My Location\"** GPS button with animated locating spinner and accuracy radius circle.\n  - **\"Reset RAK View\"** button.\n  - **\"Toggle Map Legend\"** drawer explaining pin colors and statuses.\n  - **\"Fullscreen\"** toggle button for full-screen map exploration."
    modified_response: "Here are all the major upgrades implemented across **FixMyRAK**:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Multi-Field Search Bar on Explore Reports\n- **Multi-Field Filtering**: Users can filter reports across **Description**, **Location**, or **Reporter Name** (or select **All Fields** to search across every attribute).\n- **Target Filter Buttons**: Easily toggle between `[All Fields]`, `[Description]`, `[Location]`, and `[Reporter Name]` right from the search bar.\n- **Match Reason Tagging**: When a search is performed, cards show which attribute matched (e.g., `\360\237\223\215 Matched Location: Corniche Al Qawasim` or `\360\237\221\244 Reporter: Fatima Al Mansoori`).\n- **Quick Suggested Searches**: One-click tags for popular RAK locations and keywords (`Corniche Al Qawasim`, `Al Hamra Marina`, `Khuzam`, `Fatima Al Mansoori`, `Pothole`).\n- **Instant Clear & Results Count**: Live count with a 1-click `Clear all filters` button.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Fixed & Elevated \"My Reports\" Bar\n- **Direct Navigation Tab**: Added **\"My Reports\"** directly to the main desktop navbar and mobile menu with a live badge showing how many reports you\'ve submitted.\n- **Explore Page Switcher**: Added an `[All Community Reports] | [My Reports Only]` toggle bar directly above the report feed.\n- **Dedicated Search within My Reports**: Users can quickly search their own submissions by keyword, street, or status.\n- **4-Step Municipal Progress Bar**: Each submitted report shows a visual progression bar (`1. Submitted` \342\206\222 `2. Under Review` \342\206\222 `3. In Progress` \342\206\222 `4. Resolved`) so citizens can track exact city action at a glance.\n- **\"Show on Map\" Action**: Each report card has a direct \"Show on Map\" button that immediately flies to and highlights that defect on the map.\n- **Guest-Friendly**: If browsing without signing in, visitors see a preview of how tracking works, with a quick sign-in prompt.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Translation Feature (English & Arabic)\n- **Language Switcher**: Added a language switcher (`\360\237\207\254\360\237\207\247 English / \360\237\207\246\360\237\207\252 \330\247\331\204\330\271\330\261\330\250\331\212\330\251`) in the top navigation bar and mobile drawer.\n- **Full UI Localization**: Navigation links, report statuses, categories, search placeholders, district names, and actions switch between English and Arabic.\n- **AI Report Translation**: Added a **\"Translate Report\"** button inside the report details modal. Clicking it instantly translates the report description between English and Arabic (powered by Gemini with a resilient fallback).\n\n---\n\n### 4. 100x Better Interactive Map Experience\n- **CARTO Voyager Basemap**: Active, crisp, and watermark-free with your key.\n- **Quick District Jump Bar**: Floating shortcuts to smoothly fly the camera to key RAK districts: **All RAK**, **Corniche Al Qawasim**, **Al Nakheel**, **Al Hamra**, **Mina Al Arab**, **Khuzam**, and **Jebel Jais**.\n- **Interactive Map Search**: Search any report pin or landmark right on top of the map.\n- **Rich Interactive Leaflet Popups**: Clicking any pin opens a card with the photo thumbnail, status badge, category, date, and a clickable **\"View Details\"** button.\n- **Floating Status Filter Pills**: Filter map pins directly on the map (`All`, `Submitted`, `Under Review`, `In Progress`, `Resolved`).\n- **Map Tools**:\n  - **\"My Location\"** GPS button with animated locating spinner and accuracy radius circle.\n  - **\"Reset RAK View\"** button.\n  - **\"Toggle Map Legend\"** drawer explaining pin colors and statuses.\n  - **\"Fullscreen\"** toggle button for full-screen map exploration."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\313\002\n\310\002\001i\024}\023\006\020\"\366Z\273\223QUO\031[L:\236\210\345>\305\331o\024\332c8b\003\330\240\223@\247\2449\033\200\201\240e\352\003\301\004,Z\037\364Xx\235\337\222\354o\036\251\\\330\272K\212\223\324(\335C\3050\307]M\031\337U\240\231\253 \365\337,\320%\302\266\274q3\234k\202\377\017\204x\333\344\3017\024\237\244\301\034\0231\371Z\316\362:\037\203\366rK\203\005\214[3\225Kq\033\257\273p.+OY\340\251P\223\230\201\312Ur%d\v\304H\3421 \363\324\340LGu\235RV\232\2264\336u\232\331V\307Y\356\242\350\245\226\001\225\f\354\327d\320?\307\240-\232B|\333D@\'S,\003\260\255\341\267(\347\372\006\037\205\372\315\213\335\261\233\262h\211c\376\022\230\232<\245\316\v$\354\206\341o\032\260\303\022\346\346o*\t\325G\3137p&\024\273I\0046\002\205\346\243<V\032\327\260\215\325\353\354\375\032\353\301\342M<d\006x\367@\250*\210\327\000;\347l{\207thLwG\312d\206\363\\\357\255;\235C\v\313uK\037\v\275b\252\324,\362w\245\213\236\331\215\254:\307\223\366\320\327`"
