  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 3
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **User Request**: \"Add these 4 things. Recycling, electricity saving, water saving, greener living, and remove this broad term of Waste management and replace it. Apply style changes to the selected element(s).\"\n   - **Target Element**: CSS selector: `div#root:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > main:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(3) > button:nth-of-type(4)`. This corresponds to the category filter button on the home/explore/report views, specifically targeting the \"Waste Management\" category button in the category selection row.\n   - **Core Deliverables**:\n     - Remove the broad term `\"Waste Management\"` category and replace it with 4 distinct sustainability categories:\n       1. **Recycling** (e.g., bin sorting, plastic/paper collection, e-waste drop-offs)\n       2. **Electricity Saving** (e.g., energy efficiency, street light sensor faults, power waste)\n       3. **Water Saving** (e.g., pipe leaks, irrigation overspray, water waste)\n       4. **Greener Living** (e.g., tree planting, community gardens, clean air, green spaces)\n     - Update all category types, schemas, services, AI triage prompts, translation dictionaries (`en` and `ar`), and UI views (`HomePage`, `ExplorePage`, `ReportSubmissionPage`, `MapPage`, `UserDashboardPage`, `ReportDetailModal`, and `Footer`).\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed in earlier turns**:\n     - Added English/Arabic localization via `LanguageContext.tsx` with language switcher in `Navbar.tsx`.\n     - Added Gemini translation endpoint `/api/ai/translate` in `server.ts` and `aiService.ts`.\n     - Built dedicated search bar and 4-step municipal timeline in `UserDashboardPage.tsx`.\n     - Revamped `MapComponent.tsx` and `MapPage.tsx` with CARTO Voyager basemap, district quick-jump chips, map search, rich popups, status filter pills, and fullscreen toggle.\n     - Added translation trigger button in `ReportDetailModal.tsx`.\n     - Ran `tsc --noEmit` and `compile_applet`, verified dev server restart.\n   - **In Progress / Just Received**:\n     - Received user request to replace \"Waste Management\" with: `Recycling`, `Electricity Saving`, `Water Saving`, and `Greener Living`.\n     - Inspected `focus-mode` skill (`/skills/system_skills/focus_mode/SKILL.md`). CSS block in metadata was empty `{ }`.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - In `src/types/index.ts`, `ReportCategory` is currently:\n     `\'Roads and Potholes\' | \'Streetlights\' | \'Waste Management\' | \'Pavements\' | \'Public Facilities\' | \'Other Infrastructure\'`\n   - Needs to replace `\'Waste Management\'` with `\'Recycling\' | \'Electricity Saving\' | \'Water Saving\' | \'Greener Living\'`.\n   - Also check mock/seed data in `src/services/reportService.ts` or wherever default reports are generated so any existing report referencing \"Waste Management\" maps cleanly or is updated to \"Recycling\" or \"Greener Living\".\n   - `LanguageContext.tsx` needs dictionary entries for `cat.Recycling`, `cat.Electricity Saving`, `cat.Water Saving`, `cat.Greener Living` in both English and Arabic.\n   - `HomePage.tsx` category cards grid: update the category definitions (icons like `Recycle`, `Zap`, `Droplets`, `Leaf` from `lucide-react`, matching color styles).\n   - `aiService.ts` system prompt contains a hardcoded list of categories for automatic triage: update this prompt to recognize the 4 new green categories.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - Prior error in `UserDashboardPage.tsx`: `TS2339: Property \'loginAsDemo\' does not exist on type \'AuthContextType\'`.\n     - Fixed by removing `loginAsDemo` from `useAuth()` destructuring. Verified with `lint_applet` and `compile_applet`.\n   - No current errors in the codebase.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - App running on Vite + Express (`server.ts`) on port 3000.\n   - Firebase Firestore is configured (`ai-studio-fixmyrak-8970734b-ae12-4b60-947f-c731f1bfb7cd`).\n   - CARTO API key active: `cb1_4yxz_1_3649369b315d6468ddfd0217`.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   - Step 1: Update `src/types/index.ts` to replace `\'Waste Management\'` with `\'Recycling\'`, `\'Electricity Saving\'`, `\'Water Saving\'`, `\'Greener Living\'`.\n   - Step 2: Update `src/context/LanguageContext.tsx` with English and Arabic translations for the 4 categories.\n   - Step 3: Update `src/services/aiService.ts` categorization prompt to use the new categories.\n   - Step 4: Update `src/services/reportService.ts` mock/seed reports to replace `\'Waste Management\'` references.\n   - Step 5: Update `src/pages/HomePage.tsx` category cards and category buttons (add Lucide icons `Recycle`, `Zap`, `Droplets`, `Leaf`).\n   - Step 6: Update `src/pages/ExplorePage.tsx`, `src/pages/MapPage.tsx`, `src/pages/ReportSubmissionPage.tsx`, and `src/components/Footer.tsx`.\n   - Step 7: Run `lint_applet` and `compile_applet` to confirm zero TypeScript/build errors.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Strictly follow the targeted element context from `focus-mode`: replace \"Waste Management\" with the 4 sustainability categories across the UI.\n   - Maintain anti-AI slop styling, clean Tailwind CSS, and consistent bilingual support.\n</summary>"
