    response: "The broad **\"Waste Management\"** category has been replaced across FixMyRAK with 4 dedicated sustainability categories:\n\n### 1. Replaced Categories & Features\n- **Recycling** (`Recycle` icon): Focused on segregated bins, cardboard/plastic collections, glass/can sorting, and e-waste drop-offs.\n- **Electricity Saving** (`Zap` icon): Focused on daytime lighting waste, streetlamp photo-sensor faults, and energy conservation.\n- **Water Saving** (`Droplets` icon): Focused on broken landscaping irrigation lines, sprinkler bursts, and freshwater pipe leaks.\n- **Greener Living** (`Leaf` icon): Focused on native Ghaf trees, community gardens, mangrove eco-trails, and green space care.\n\n### 2. Styling & UI Enhancements\n- **Category Filter Pills (`ExploreReportsPage` & `MapPage`)**: Enhanced with category icons, live count indicators, and sleek active/hover states (`bg-[#143d35]` with subtle shadows and border rings).\n- **Home Page Category Cards**: Added 4 distinct pastel color palettes and custom icons for each sustainability category.\n- **Bilingual Localization**: Added full English and Arabic translations in `LanguageContext.tsx` (`\330\245\330\271\330\247\330\257\330\251 \330\247\331\204\330\252\330\257\331\210\331\212\330\261`, `\330\252\330\261\330\264\331\212\330\257 \330\247\331\204\331\203\331\207\330\261\330\250\330\247\330\241 \331\210\330\247\331\204\330\267\330\247\331\202\330\251`, `\330\252\330\261\330\264\331\212\330\257 \330\247\331\204\331\205\331\212\330\247\331\207 \331\210\330\247\331\204\330\255\331\201\330\247\330\270 \330\271\331\204\331\212\331\207\330\247`, `\330\247\331\204\330\255\331\212\330\247\330\251 \330\247\331\204\330\256\330\266\330\261\330\247\330\241 \331\210\330\247\331\204\330\247\330\263\330\252\330\257\330\247\331\205\330\251`).\n- **AI Triage & Rules**: Updated the Gemini categorization prompt and rule-based fallback heuristics in `server.ts` to classify incoming reports into these new categories."
