erties are key, I\'m trying to see how they\'re connected to the user\'s action and the states of the buttons.\n\n\n\n**Assessing Dynamic Rendering**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the conditional rendering logic of the category pills. I\'m focusing on the interplay between `isSelected`, `isAll`, and the associated styling. It\'s incredibly satisfying to see how the user\'s selected category is vividly emphasized with deep green highlighting, and clear white text, and a vibrant emerald badge. It\'s working seamlessly, and I\'m really pleased with the clear hierarchy.\n\n\n"
