    thinking: "**Analyzing the Requests**\n\nI\'m focusing on the user request, \"add this to the maps and let AI work in the apps using data being given by users,\" and the associated metadata, specifically the \"Use Google Maps data\" feature request. The metadata guides me to incorporate user-provided data into applications. I need to consider how to best integrate Google Maps data while ensuring AI can effectively utilize user input.\n\n\n**Integrating Maps & AI**\n\nI\'m now incorporating maps grounding, as instructed, using `gemini-3.8-flash` with the Google Maps tool for the app. I must always ensure that Google Maps-based information is up-to-date and accurate within the application. I must also load the firebase skill when processing queries. I\'m taking care to extract URLs from the grounding chunks to display them on the web app as links.\n\n\n**Developing AI Feature**\n\nI am now focusing on the AI feature within the app, specifically integrating user-provided data with `gemini-3.8-flash` and the `googleMaps` tool. I\'m focusing on the Interactive Map Page and the AI\'s role in providing insights grounded in Google Maps data. I will use navigator.geolocation to include the user location, as requested. The integration of Firestore and state data is critical for real-time AI engagement.\n\n\n**Enhancing Location Insights**\n\nI am now focusing on integrating live community reports from Firestore with Google Maps data, specifically analyzing user submissions within a given area. The AI will cross-reference user reports with Google Maps place knowledge, providing up-to-date neighborhood analyses and actionable insights. The AI verifies locations and assists with report details using Google Maps grounding. The user interface will highlight the grounding sources.\n\n\n"
